<title>FRANCE: Total boosted by sales rise.</title>
<headline>Total boosted by sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in oil group Total SA were boosted by a general market recovery and a rise of 19.4 percent in first half sales, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0813 GMT, Total was up 2.74 percent at 601 francs while the CAC-40 index was up 1.25 percent at 2,905.92.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
